From 9b25450b5e84a4cb3077625b8156a3196a220d1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: callan <callanf@nvidia.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:46:56 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 13/38] feat(replay): closed-loop users in the agentic driver

N user slots play scheduled copies of play templates (hash ids stored as deltas per
template), each copy instantiated when its user starts it and freed when it settles,
with its own block identity range and cp<key>: request ids; the next entry starts after
a cooldown (a longer one after a failed play); nothing is dispatched at or after the
horizon. WorkloadDriver::new_agentic_users; off unless used.
